{"2786900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spikerz! Volleyball", "steam_appid": 2786900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/28e09d18389506a2376f74df53f9529e.poster.avif?t=1780073319\" width=600 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/28e09d18389506a2376f74df53f9529e.webm?t=1780073319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spikerz!</strong> puts you right on the court. Take full control of your character and master every technique: <strong>serves, digs, sets, spikes, dives, feints, and blocks</strong> to dominate the court!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/585e477c458b5973df0ce4e580499ea3.poster.avif?t=1780073319\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/585e477c458b5973df0ce4e580499ea3.webm?t=1780073319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/585e477c458b5973df0ce4e580499ea3.mp4?t=1780073319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quick Match</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play intense matches against your friends or the AI.</strong> <strong>Up to 4 players</strong> can compete in <strong>local multiplayer</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your playstyle by adjusting your character's stats such as <strong>strength, jump, and speed</strong> to become a devastating Spikerz! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with your partner</strong> to create openings, score points, and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tournament</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter tournaments and compete for the cups!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with a friend or an AI teammate</strong> and cooperate to defeat all your opponents. But be careful, the difficulty ramps up with every win! <strong>Do you have what it takes to bring home every trophy?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/cd51f38c19e7b95a857010b984f97fac.poster.avif?t=1780073319\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/cd51f38c19e7b95a857010b984f97fac.webm?t=1780073319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/cd51f38c19e7b95a857010b984f97fac.mp4?t=1780073319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Look</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edit every pixel of your character's head</strong> to make it look just like you <i>(or not!)</i>. Use the coins earned in matches to unlock new colors and unique accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/f7a77ae73772c2b9df48b29050c15926.avif?t=1780073319\" width=600 height=123 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c